    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/catering-lite/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Catering Lite is a free, feature-rich, and professionally designed theme created for caterers, food service providers, event planners, wedding caterers, corporate catering businesses, food courts, party planners, menu management services, and other food-related ventures seeking a strong online presence. Built on the Bootstrap framework, it features a clean, responsive, and user-friendly layout enhanced with elegant CSS animations and interactive elements that create an engaging browsing experience. The theme includes essential sections such as Team, Testimonials, service highlights, and a prominent Call to Action (CTA) button to drive inquiries, bookings, and customer engagement. Catering Lite offers extensive customization options, allowing easy adjustments to color schemes, typography, layouts, and responsive sliders to align perfectly with your brand identity. Its SEO-friendly structure and fast-loading, optimized code help improve search visibility and ensure smooth performance across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. The theme is compatible with WooCommerce for online food ordering, Contact Form 7 for inquiries, Yoast SEO for search optimization, WPML for multilingual websites, and social media integration for broader reach. Ideal for catering websites, event planning services, and restaurant service pages, Catering Lite delivers a dynamic, reliable, and conversion-focused foundation for growing food and catering businesses online.View: https://preview.themesglance.com/catering-pro/"
    },
